IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `uc-core`
IMPORT `uc4-sch6-descriptors`

-- Tests of uc4-sch6-descriptors.l4: Schedule 6 and regulation 39(3) to (5).
-- Every expected value is written by hand from the text (the digits of the points cells, regulation 39(3) to (5)), beside the assertion.

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Column (3): the points of every descriptor. Row by row, from the digits of the points cell split as the module's comment says
-- (fork F-points): activity 1 is 159960 = 15, 9, 9, 6, 0; activity 5 is 1515990 = 15, 15, 9, 9, 0; activity 17 is 151590 = 15, 15, 9, 0.
#ASSERT `Sch 6 activity 1 — the points for a descriptor` `Sch 6 descriptor 1(a)` EQUALS 15
#ASSERT `Sch 6 activity 1 — the points for a descriptor` `Sch 6 descriptor 1(b)` EQUALS 9
#ASSERT `Sch 6 activity 1 — the points for a descriptor` `Sch 6 descriptor 1(c)` EQUALS 9
#ASSERT `Sch 6 activity 1 — the points for a descriptor` `Sch 6 descriptor 1(d)` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `Sch 6 activity 1 — the points for a descriptor` `Sch 6 descriptor 1(e)` EQUALS 0
