#ASSERT `Sch 6 activity 5 — the points for a descriptor` `Sch 6 descriptor 5(c)` EQUALS 9
#ASSERT `Sch 6 activity 5 — the points for a descriptor` `Sch 6 descriptor 5(d)` EQUALS 9
#ASSERT `Sch 6 activity 5 — the points for a descriptor` `Sch 6 descriptor 5(e)` EQUALS 0
